# 💬 OPIc Expressions - Day 08

## Expression

What I like most is...

Meaning

제가 가장 좋아하는 것은...

---

## Examples

What I like most is spending time with my family.

What I like most is learning new skills.

What I like most is studying AI and English.

---

## Useful Alternatives

- My favorite thing is...
- I really enjoy...
- One thing I love is...
